tle_fr":"Les Liaisons dangereuses","original_title":"Dangerous Liaisons","tagline":null,"description":"يلتزم السجين السابق ديلان بقواعد الإفراج المشروط عنه. ولكن عندما يموت شقيقه في ظروف غامضة، يقرر مخالفتها والانطلاق بحثا عن الحقيقة.","description_en":"In 18th century France, Marquise de Merteuil asks her ex-lover Vicomte de Valmont to seduce the future wife of another ex-lover of hers in return for one last night with her. Yet things don’t go as planned.","description_fr":"Deux aristocrates brillants et spirituels, la marquise de Merteuil et le séduisant Vicomte de Valmont, signent un pacte d'inviolable amitié à la fin de leur liaison. C'est au nom de celui-ci que la marquise demande à Valmont de séduire la candide Cécile de Volanges qui doit prochainement épouser son ex-favori, M. de Bastide. Mais Valmont a entrepris de séduire la vertueuse Mme de Tourvel.","poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/7etDozwd9Pf5oCcyo4h1Hki6U13.jpg","backdrop":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/xH9mjObdAatWoHpT912DDK8hEYG.jpg","has_poster":true,"rating":7.2,"vote_count":1333,"age_rating":"R","year":"1988","release_date":"1988-12-21","runtime_minutes":119,"status":"Released","country":"الولايات المتحدة","language":"الإنجليزية","genres":["دراما","رومنسية","إثارة","أكشن"],"genre_keys":["drama","romance","thriller","action"],"similar":["mv38234","mv11636","mv445651","mv59967","mv14194","mv620240","mv2207","mv405889"],"director":"Stephen Frears","cast":[{"name":"غلين كلوز","character":"Marquise Isabelle de Merteuil","profile_image":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/4VHZ1GfLwN7MUgApy0LCBzdDF9L.jpg"},{"name":"جون مالكوفيتش","character":"Vicomte Sébastien de Valmont","profile_image":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/7GoOdGNc4ra1L0F5nJTkmIB37iu.jpg"},{"name":"ميشيل فايفر","character":"Madame Marie de Tourvel","profile_image":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/8qwNMFzmM3BxGKIj1iIqiHHBpx3.jpg"},{"name":"أوما ثورمان","character":"Cécile de Volanges","profile_image":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/s