 confier une petite mission. Il doit escorter Eddie Bunker jusqu’au palais de justice où, deux heures plus tard, celui-ci témoignera dans une importante affaire de meurtre. La corvée ne devait prendre que dix minutes, le temps de remonter les seize pâtés de maison. Mais tout va déraper car certains sont prêts à tout pour que le témoin gênant n’arrive jamais au tribunal.","poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/cBLqMVfTZpuKmMQKDLKusb93dbR.jpg","backdrop":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/z7BhlDkhAprUHugZlkVB9TPcB0T.jpg","has_poster":true,"rating":6.5,"vote_count":2217,"age_rating":"PG-13","year":"2006","release_date":"2006-03-01","runtime_minutes":105,"status":"Released","country":"الولايات المتحدة","language":"الإنجليزية","genres":["حركة","مغامرة","جريمة","إثارة","دراما","أكشن"],"genre_keys":["action","adventure","crime","thriller","drama"],"similar":["mv603692","mv38234","mv11636","mv14194","mv620240","mv405889","mv1096197","mv91550"],"director":"Richard Donner","cast":[{"name":"Bruce Willis","character":"Jack Mosley","profile_image":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/w3aXr1e7gQCn8MSp1vW4sXHn99P.jpg"},{"name":"Yasiin Bey","character":"Eddie Bunker","profile_image":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/cu6pZ0ThtrT9Mo3l2cKk3UjYhmE.jpg"},{"name":"David Morse","character":"Frank Nugent","profile_image":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/A6zGbkFjM3uajIakgsSeNTmSKqY.jpg"},{"name":"جينا ستيرن","character":"Diane Mosley","profile_image":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/eQQQNOpZBwsPmEAFETFNFE9xenV.jpg"},{"name":"Casey Sander","character":"Captain Gruber","profile_image":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/xHVyamqUbJK2dmFCw7LOQzYREJF.jpg"},{"name":"Cylk Cozart","character":"Jimmy Mulvey","profile_image":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/nk5nsCvNG8mUQfZPJU40EewtOGo.jpg"},{"name":"David Zayas","character":"Robert Torres","profile_image":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/w1E8n9gl2HcZEhfBOXdVzMvIlzg.jpg"},{"name":"Robert Racki","character":"Jerry Shue","profile_image":"https://image.tmdb.org