5","tmdb_id":457335,"content_type":"movie","title":"Guns Akimbo","title_en":null,"title_fr":null,"original_title":null,"tagline":null,"description":"يصارع شاب يطور ألعاب فيديو للبقاء على قيد الحياة بعد تورطه مع منصة غير قانونية تبث لجمهورها المتعصب لعبة الموت التي تحدث في شوارع المدينة.","description_en":"An ordinary guy suddenly finds himself forced to fight a gladiator-like battle for a dark website that streams the violence for viewers. In order to survive and rescue his kidnapped ex-girlfriend, he must battle Nix, a heavily armed and much more experienced fighter.","description_fr":"Dans une réalité alternative pas très éloignée de la nôtre, une émission clandestine hyper-violente, Skizm, cartonne sur le dark web. Retransmise en direct, elle consiste en un jeu mortel diffusé en direct où des inconnus et des criminels s'entre-tuent. Le meurtre est devenu un concept de divertissement, ce qui ne choque personne sauf un développeur de jeux vidéos raté, Miles, qui, sur le forum de l'émission, insulte violemment ses nombreux spectateurs. Mais ses critiques ne sont pas passées inaperçues et, chez lui, il est aussitôt agressé et drogué par les organisateurs du jeu de massacre...","poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/2kNnf7BwRCEm4bcFkdiE0T4U25s.jpg","backdrop":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/jKnZ3CavwSTsBbgSpAhQU8Z9nOy.jpg","has_poster":true,"rating":6.4,"vote_count":2709,"age_rating":"R","year":"2020","release_date":"2020-02-27","runtime_minutes":98,"status":"Released","country":"ألمانيا","language":"الإنجليزية","genres":["حركة","كوميديا","إثارة","جريمة","أكشن","كوميدي"],"genre_keys":["action","comedy","thriller","crime"],"similar":["mv522931","mv617502","mv91550","mv8860","mv393","mv603692","mv207703","mv38234"],"director":"Jason Lei Howden","cast":[{"name":"دانيال رادكليف","character":"Miles","profile_image":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/uUFfo8RANo7tuckB6AZAnESne55.jpg"},{"name":"سمارة ويفنغ","character":"Nix","profile_image":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/