:null,"tagline":null,"description":"يجد ضابط قوات خاصة نفسه عالقا داخل دوامة زمنية تجبره أن يعيش يوم موته مرارا وتكرارا.","description_en":"","description_fr":"","poster":null,"backdrop":"https://shahid.mbc.net/mediaObject/2023/Hanin/Thump_BOSS_LEVEL/original/Thump_BOSS_LEVEL.jpg","has_poster":false,"rating":null,"vote_count":null,"age_rating":null,"year":null,"release_date":null,"runtime_minutes":null,"status":null,"country":null,"language":null,"genres":["خيالي علمي","غموض","أكشن"],"genre_keys":["scifi","mystery","action"],"similar":["mv59965","mv76341","mv1071585","mv445651","mv59967","mv1930","mv2059","mv619778"],"director":null,"cast":[],"trailer_url":null,"seasons_count":null,"episodes_count":null,"all_airings":[{"channel_id":"MoviesAction.sa@SD","start":"2026-11-26T14:33:08Z","stop":"2026-11-26T16:18:08Z","start_ts":1795703588,"stop_ts":1795709888,"season":null,"episode":null},{"channel_id":"MoviesAction.sa@SD","start":"2026-11-26T21:33:08Z","stop":"2026-11-26T23:18:08Z","start_ts":1795728788,"stop_ts":1795735088,"season":null,"episode":null},{"channel_id":"MoviesAction.sa@SD","start":"2026-11-27T04:33:08Z","stop":"2026-11-27T06:18:08Z","start_ts":1795753988,"stop_ts":1795760288,"season":null,"episode":null}]},"mv59965":{"show_id":"mv59965","tmdb_id":59965,"content_type":"movie","title":"Abduction","title_en":null,"title_fr":"Identité secrète","original_title":null,"tagline":"لقد سرقوا حياته. إنه يستعيدها.","description":"عندما يلتقي رجلان في رحلتهما للبحث عن أفراد عائلاتهما المخطوفة، يتوجب عليهما توحيد قواهما لمحاربة الخاطفين، وهم مخلوقات غامضة لم يرها أحدا من قبل.","description_en":"For many years, Nathan Harper has had the uneasy feeling that life with his family isn't quite what it seems. As he draws closer to uncovering the truth, he is hunted by assassins, forcing him to flee with his neighbor, Karen, the only person he can trust.","description_fr":"Nathan Harper a toujours éprouvé la désagréable impression de mener une vie qui n’est pas la sienne. Lorsqu’il tombe par hasard sur une photo de lui, enfant, sur un site de personnes disparues, ses peurs les plus sombres deviennent brusquement réalité. Ses parents ne sont pas les siens, sa vie n’est qu’un mensonge soigneusement fabriqué pour cacher une vérité aussi mystérieuse que dangereuse... Alors qu’il commence à rassembler les pièces du puzzle, Nathan est pris pour cible par des tueurs. Il est obligé de fuir en compagnie de la seule personne en qui il ait confiance, sa voisine, Karen. Tandis que les deux jeunes gens s’efforcent d’échapper à une armée de tueurs et d’agents gouvernementaux, Nathan réalise que sa seule chance de survivre – et de résoudre le mystère de sa véritable identité – est d’affronter la situation à sa façon…","poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/d0TIDrwnMFVjg2EO4LsXQn1mbbc.jpg","backdrop":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/6wWIirFFZPQx7Lamh1iKMgbVezr.jpg","has_poster":true,"rating":5.8,"vote_count":3107,"age_rating":"13","year":"2011","release_date":"2011-09-22","runtime_minutes":106,"status":"Released","country":"الولايات المتحدة","language":"الإنجليزية","genres":["إثارة","حركة","غموض","خيالي علمي","أكشن"],"genre_keys":["thriller","action","mystery","scifi"],"similar":["mv1071585","mv59967","mv937249","mv46529","mv406761","mv8698","mv10771","mv393"],"director":"John Singleton","cast":[{"name":"تايلور لوتنر","character":"Nathan Harper","profile_image":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/xyRXoKM7UQdijwmjpiCcLGPzcc7.jpg"},{"name":"ليلي كولينز","character":"Karen Murphy","profile_image":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/5bhcp0CyTdHgfW8x45ZKewDnjMc.jpg"},{"name":"ألفريد مولينا","character":"Frank Burton","profile_image":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/nJo91Czesn6z0d0pkfbDoVZY3sg.jpg"},{"name":"سيغورني ويفر","character":"Dr. Geraldine 'Geri' Bennett","profile_image":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/wTSnfktNBLd6kwQxgvkqYw6vEon.jpg"},{"name":"جايسون إسحاق","character":"Kevin Harper","profile_image":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/s6XRFjqUsrDJfDQuXPO